Attribution
-----------

"xkcd Script" is derived from the handwriting of Randall Munroe (https://xkcd.com)
and is distributed by the IPython project at https://github.com/ipython/xkcd-font.

Terms in brief
--------------

You are free to share and adapt this font, provided you give appropriate
credit, for NON-COMMERCIAL purposes only. Commercial use is not permitted
under this license.

If you fork this project for commercial use, remove this font and substitute a
permissively licensed hand-drawn typeface (Comic Neue, Patrick Hand, and
Shantell Sans are all available under the SIL Open Font License). The font is
referenced from `app/globals.css` (`@font-face`) and
`components/charts/shared/config.ts` (`FONT_FAMILY`).
